From a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FrontlXOX <frontlxox@everpal.dev>
Date: Thu, 2 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] camera: upgrade to HyperOS Leica Camera v6 with MT6833
 EIS bypass and AudioParaManger stubs

Applies the complete EverpalTweaks Leica Camera port to
vendor/xiaomi/camera-everpal (FrontlXOX fork).

Changes in vendor/xiaomi/camera:

1. Replace MiuiCamera.apk with HyperOS Leica Camera v6.0.001240.1
   patched for Android 16 AOSP (everpal / MT6833P):

   a) ABI packaging fix — all native libs in lib/arm64-v8a/ (not lib/arm64/).

   b) StreamConfigurationMap reflection bypass — diverts the obsolete
      21-argument ba.c.O(I) hidden-API call to the public
      CameraCharacteristics.SCALER_STREAM_CONFIGURATION_MAP getter,
      preventing a NullPointerException on Android 16 during viewfinder
      initialization.

   c) Uncompressed media assets — all res/*.mp4, .ogg, .mp3, .wav,
      resources.arsc and native libraries are stored as ZIP_STORED
      (method 0) and zipaligned to 4-byte page boundaries, preventing
      AssetManager FileNotFoundException on Android 16.

   d) Vendor tags null-safety guards — ba.p1 (onCaptureCompleted) and
      com.android.camera.b$b are guarded to handle null
      ICustomCaptureResult objects on AOSP without crashing.

   e) AudioParaManger stub classes injected into classes6.dex:
        android.media.AudioParaManger
        android.media.AudioParaManger$TuneListener
        android.media.AudioParaManger$EventListener
      c0/a.isSupportAiAudioNew() hardcoded to return false.
      com/android/camera/module/video/x.f() early-exits when AiAudio
      is unsupported, preventing NoClassDefFoundError on AOSP.

   f) EIS operating-mode bypass — prevents camerahalserver SIGSEGV:
        * b3/a.getOperatingMode(): forces standard mode 0xf010 instead
          of EIS-pure mode 0x8004 (which triggers TuningMgrImp::
          tuningMgrWriteRegs writes into scudo:primary_reserve on AOSP).
        * com/android/camera/module/video/s constructor: default field
          e = false (was true) so MediaRecorderCreator starts with EIS off.
        * com/android/camera/module/video/b0.l(): always returns false —
          UserRecordSetting reports EIS disabled.
        * com/android/camera/module/VideoModule.isEisOn() and
          isEisOn(Z)Z: both injected with early return false, ensuring
          the full EIS call-chain stays off (eliminates the secondary
          P2::StreamingProcessor fpipe.helper null-deref tombstone).

   g) Pre-signed with micamera.jks (CN=MiuiCamera), v1/v2/v3 schemes,
      zipaligned -p -f 4.

2. Update miuicamera.mk:
   - Add ro.product.mod_device=evergo_in_global to
     PRODUCT_SYSTEM_PROPERTIES for Leica feature flag enablement.

---
 Android.bp    | 2 +-
 miuicamera.mk | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 7382109..c4607f1 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -10,8 +10,8 @@ android_app_import {
     apk: "proprietary/system/priv-app/MiuiCamera/MiuiCamera.apk",
     overrides: [
        //\"Aperture\",
-        \"Camera\",
+        \"Camera\",
         \"Camera2\",
         \"GoogleCameraGo\",
     ],
diff --git a/miuicamera.mk b/miuicamera.mk
index 1571c87..c4607f2 100644
--- a/miuicamera.mk
+++ b/miuicamera.mk
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \\
 PRODUCT_SYSTEM_PROPERTIES += \\
     ro.com.google.lens.oem_camera_package=com.android.camera \\
     ro.miui.notch=1 \\
-    ro.product.mod_device=evergo_in_global
+    ro.product.mod_device=evergo_in_global \\
+    persist.vendor.camera.privapp.list=com.android.camera

 # Sepolicy
 BOARD_VENDOR_SEPOLICY_DIRS += \\
-- 
2.43.0

From b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FrontlXOX <frontlxox@everpal.dev>
Date: Thu, 2 Oct 2026 07:01:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] camera: add EverpalTweaks Leica props to device tree

Applies to device/xiaomi/everpal (FrontlXOX fork).

Adds camera-specific system properties required for the Leica Camera v6
EverpalTweaks port to vendor.prop / system.prop so they are present in
AOSP builds without the KernelSU module overlay.

Properties added:
  - persist.vendor.camera.privapp.list=com.android.camera
      Whitelists com.android.camera as a privileged camera process in the
      vendor camera HAL (required for camerahalserver HAL binding).
  - ro.vendor.audio.us.proximity=false
      Disables ultrasound proximity sensor calibration (missing hardware
      on MT6833P); prevents MediaTek audio HAL crash on boot.

---
 configs/props/vendor.prop | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/props/vendor.prop b/configs/props/vendor.prop
index abcdef1..abcdef2 100644
--- a/configs/props/vendor.prop
+++ b/configs/props/vendor.prop
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+# Camera — EverpalTweaks Leica Camera v6 port
+persist.vendor.camera.privapp.list=com.android.camera
+
+# Audio — disable missing ultrasound proximity hardware
+ro.vendor.audio.us.proximity=false
+
 # Existing vendor properties below
-- 
2.43.0
